<author id="830549">haukex</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;You are trying to paint me with a broad and inaccurate brush.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I explained myself at length [id://11105374|here], you never responded. I'm not sure how else you expect me to interpret your various writings on Perl 6. To me, you &lt;i&gt;appear&lt;/i&gt; to have a giant chip on your shoulder.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;I'm not sure what your agenda is either in flogging the dead horse of "Raku is Perl"&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When did I say that? I cited my sources, you didn't, so I'm just pointing out your &lt;i&gt;apparent&lt;/i&gt; bias that seems to me to be affecting your interpretations, be it your interpretations of what the Perl 6 devs said, Monastery policy, or what I wrote. Sorry to be so direct, but I'm tired of your rhetoric, and I'm not going to waste my time on your strawmen, so I'm out.&lt;/p&gt;
</doctext>
